6561198077876800", "personaname": "Nuts", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198077876800/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 11604, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11571, "last_played": 1787027789, "avatar": "949bd122dd9813ec7d903a820c3ec22f955fb4d5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Finally escape from tarkov into a better game", "timestamp_created": 1770507050, "timestamp_updated": 1770507050, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217817965", "author": {"steamid": "76561199093619680", "personaname": "Anthonyirll [TTV]", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199093619680/", "num_games_owned": 57, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 23616, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 18213, "last_played": 1778401811, "avatar": "5c51ca468a1d37f32931d310ea391b87c294d082"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't get me wrong, I love this game. However, I cannot recommend it in its current state due to a handful of reasons. \n\n1. These little patch notes/updates that you do not see have kicked me out of the server, unable to rejoin and I lost whole loadouts that I grinded for and never gotten back due to the patches. I work 12 hour night shifts and on my days off I do want to play this game but its getting worse and worse to the point I get to play one game and the next game its a server issue and I loose that loadout because of it. Like I might as well just drop my loadout for someone cuz what's the point if the next game I cant play it due to servers being ♥♥♥♥. \n\n2. There is no counter to ratting which is a huge flaw the game does have, I know the people who do it and actually cannot hold a 1v1 are going to say, \"skill issue\" or \" Tagging grenade\"! First off id whoop your ass in a 1v1, second tagging grenades are so useless due to one reason. It tags already dead raiders which throws you off completely and does not give you the information you really want to know. I think ive died more times using the tagging grenade than to rats and that is the only information tool you can use which sucks. But until they either fix them or add in something better there is no counter to ratting which is crazy. \n\n3. SPAWNS.... Holy F the spawns in this game are the worst I have seen in any game ( even call of duty has better spawning and that says A LOT ). I have spawned and walked a few steps and instantly someone is crouched waiting and a few bodies are in front of me just around the corner. Like is it hard to implement safe spawn or at least a invincibility timer for new spawns. I was in stella Assembly I killed 3 guys and as I am running down to get to the ramp jump into lobby I hear someone spawn and I killed him before he even fully loaded in. I felt so bad and he came in with a full loadout. Like the game straight gave me loot. You can actively hear someone spawning in and the fact it was right next to me is a horrible design flaw by the devs. Late spawns should only cater to free loadouts or just get rid of them. \n\n4. There needs to be a harder matchmaking for PvE/PvP I get its a PvPvE however people actively get into these nice lobbies because A. you want to PVE or B. You realize you cant handle the PvPers in the game so you free kit your next 5 games then load into a Matriarch or Harvester because you now know you are in friendly lobbies and can stab them in the back. This kills it for the true PvE players and multiple times I just sold all of my stash because what is the point. Why don't you add three modes and get rid of 1v3s cuz that was for less than 1% of the players. Add PvE and everyone is a friendly, then PvPvE where it gives all aspects, then finally PvP lobbies only so you know exactly what you are getting into and what to expect. Because the way its at now and what you can abuse is really not good especially for new players. Or even do a if you are over a certain amount of kills you can never go truly back to PvE lobbies but you can still get into friendly lobbies UNTIL the next expedition reset so every season you can choose what path of matchmaking you want to do. \n\nI would very much recommend the game if they fix the server issues. But the server issues was the nail in the coffin for me everything else was not okay but i'll live. If you don't agree with this that is fine everyone has opinions or feedback of what they notice and ideas to help. But if you gonna be a ass about it you can gargle me. If you do agree then cool go bake some cookies.", "timestamp_created": 1770506897, "timestamp_updated": 1770506897, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1761816609", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "217817930", "author": {"steamid": "76561198071283942", "personaname": "savanashi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198071283942/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 10915, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1230, "last_played": 1776843270, "avatar": "8cb45e0bfa266570ef191221e6ff659f2888867f"}, "language": "english", "review": "fire", "timestamp_created": 1770506863, "timestamp_updated": 1770506863, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "a